  "Benefit: Tor helps hide your real IP from other peers.\n\nTrade-offs: Connecting and syncing may be slower, and battery and data use may increase. Transaction records remain public. If Tor fails, direct connections stay disabled.": "Tor\n\n優點：有助向其他節點隱藏你的真實 IP。\n\n缺點：連線與同步可能變慢，電池及數據用量可能增加。交易紀錄仍然公開。此連線失敗時不會切換至直接連線。",
  "Benefit: I2P helps hide your real IP from other I2P peers.\n\nTrade-offs: I2P peers are required. Connecting and syncing may be slower, and battery and data use may increase. Transaction records remain public. If I2P fails, direct connections stay disabled.": "I2P\n\n優點：有助向其他節點隱藏你的真實 IP。\n\n缺點：連線與同步可能變慢，電池及數據用量可能增加。交易紀錄仍然公開。此連線失敗時不會切換至直接連線。\n\n需要 I2P 節點。",
